{"id":"5a339e72892676e7","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-natural-deduction-validity.md","title":"带开放假设判断的经典有效性","display":"df-natural-deduction-validity — 带开放假设判断的经典有效性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-natural-deduction-validity","aliases":["72-df-natural-deduction-validity"],"display":"df-natural-deduction-validity — 带开放假设判断的经典有效性","depends_on":["[[72-df-natural-deduction]]","[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.4.7, print47–50/PDF59–62; local explicit semantic interface","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-natural-deduction-validity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-natural-deduction-validity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-natural-deduction-validity — 带开放假设判断的经典有效性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c916f34e9cc3391\" href=\"?note=4c916f34e9cc3391\" title=\"72-df-natural-deduction\">72-df-natural-deduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.4.7, print47–50/PDF59–62; local explicit semantic interface"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_N=\\mathsf{Asm}\\times X_N\">\\(Q_N=\\mathsf{Asm}\\times X_N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4c916f34e9cc3391\" href=\"?note=4c916f34e9cc3391\" title=\"72-df-natural-deduction\">72-df-natural-deduction</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\\)</span> 是签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 的合法非空身份等号结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in D^V\">\\(s\\in D^V\\)</span>；公式真值取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal V^N_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)\\in Q_N:\n\\forall s\\in D^V\\ ((\\forall B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(H)\\ \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(B)=1)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(A)=1)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{NDValid}_\\Sigma(q)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow q\\in Q_N\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\ (\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\Rightarrow q\\in\\mathcal V^N_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal V^N_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)\\in Q_N:\n\\forall s\\in D^V\\ ((\\forall B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(H)\\ \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(B)=1)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(A)=1)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{NDValid}_\\Sigma(q)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow q\\in Q_N\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\ (\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\Rightarrow q\\in\\mathcal V^N_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>假设类可以有多个出现，但 ran(H) 的真假足以解释判断。有效性对结构内全部赋值量化；因此全称引入不能仅在一个固定赋值处使用。判断的定义域是 Q_N，没有在非法输入上调用部分投影。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-natural-deduction","status":"resolved","id":"4c916f34e9cc3391","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-natural-deduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-natural-deduction","status":"resolved","id":"4c916f34e9cc3391","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q_N=\\mathsf{Asm}\\times X_N$、$\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)$ 取 [[72-df-natural-deduction]]。$\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle$ 是签名 $\\Sigma$ 的合法非空身份等号结构，$s\\in D^V$；公式真值取 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q_N=\\mathsf{Asm}\\times X_N$、$\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)$ 取 [[72-df-natural-deduction]]。$\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle$ 是签名 $\\Sigma$ 的合法非空身份等号结构，$s\\in D^V$；公式真值取 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"